Your pet will attack anything whose hit dice are sufficiently low and
which your pet *thinks* can't kill it in a single round of attacks.
Your pet does not calculate this latter possibility correctly in certain
circumstances.

So, there are two issues:

If your pet is badly hurt, it won't defend you.
If your pet underestimates an opponent's threat, it will get itself
killed.

